  lines:
  - characterName: Tree soul
    characterEmote: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13f9b420960cfad43aea6b1b76c698ee, type: 3}
    text: I can feel the presence of a new soul
  - characterName: Tree soul
    characterEmote: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13f9b420960cfad43aea6b1b76c698ee, type: 3}
    text: Why are you here, child?
  - characterName: Mark
    characterEmote: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 08b7620d99209c4409c4cbfb1dea97c0, type: 3}
    text: I want to stop the pollution andsave the humankind
  - characterName: Tree soul
    characterEmote: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13f9b420960cfad43aea6b1b76c698ee, type: 3}
    text: Well then, you need to watch the tape on TV
  - characterName: Tree soul
    characterEmote: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 13f9b420960cfad43aea6b1b76c698ee, type: 3}
    text: so you can learn the story of this building
